users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Changing String->StringName and modifying the importer should generally be fine.\r\n\r\nHowever, this PR's changes to AnimationTree completely break the behavior for nested AnimationNodeBlendTree instances. When I looked at the code, I noticed that the way AnimationNode instances are accessed has changed and since that concerns me, I tested it.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3059325-a426-4d26-a8ef-f2f218183e39\r\n\r\nAfter this PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8cb2dd2-42a7-4820-b04a-cb29865ef008\r\n\r\n[nested_tree.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22705440/nested_tree.zip)\r\n\r\nTherefore, I recommend removing the AnimationTree's change to how AnimationNode instances are accessed from this PR for now. And if you really want to implement it, it would be better to create a separate PR for that.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110474#pullrequestreview-3302152139","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110474","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110474#pullrequestreview-3302152139"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110474"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-05T03:12:00Z","commit_id":"834f8fb71ea641997213202c3b3647e0dda137c6"}]